    "description": "Read the disposition policy table: the version, the return window in days, the maximum units per return line, the veto outcome a guardrail demotes to (default DISPOSE), the declared instant and the rule table mapping each inspection grade (A, B, C, SCRAP) and product class to an outcome (RESTOCK, REFURBISH, LIQUIDATE, DISPOSE, RTV); \"*\" is the default product class of a rule. Omitting version reads the CURRENT version; passing a version number reads that declared one (the policy is append-only: a change is a new version, never a rewrite). Read-only; fails with policy-not-found when the version does not exist.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "version": {
          "description": "optional declared version to read; omitted means the CURRENT policy version",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "name": "get_disposition_policy",
    "outputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
